0..57 Comment "//! This source models writes under a unique string hold."
58..61 Comment "//!"
62..140 Comment "//! Copy-on-write reads a holder count at each write. A string with one holder"
141..216 Comment "//! can write without that count. A shared write changes bytes that another"
217..234 Comment "//! string reads."
235..238 Comment "//!"
239..316 Comment "//! `pushInPlace` writes without the holder count. A grade-one hold certifies"
317..391 Comment "//! that no copy shares its string. The checker refuses a grade-one copied"
392..403 Comment "//! string."
404..407 Comment "//!"
408..486 Comment "//! - cites: [Racordon-2022-implementation_strategies_mutable_value_semantics]"
487..490 Comment "//!"
491..675 Comment "//! [Racordon-2022-implementation_strategies_mutable_value_semantics]: https://doi.org/10.5381/jot.2022.21.2.a2 \"Racordon et al., Implementation strategies for mutable value semantics\""
